          "message": "I've implemented and verified the solution. Let me provide a summary before submitting.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the requested `Worktree.Merge` feature in go-git on a new branch `worktree-merge` from `main`, with the following changes:\n\n### New file: `worktree_merge.go`\n- Added `Worktree.Merge(target plumbing.Hash, opts *MergeOptions) error`:\n  - Returns `ErrUncommittedChanges` if the worktree is dirty.\n  - Fast-forwards when possible (updates HEAD/index/worktree).\n  - Otherwise performs a 3-way merge; creates a merge commit with parents `[HEAD, target]` on success.\n  - Works with empty `MergeOptions{}` even without repository user config (falls back to a default author).\n- Full tree/merge logic:\n  - Auto-merges non-overlapping changes in the same file via a line-based 3-way merge that correctly handles repeated/identical lines.\n  - Non-conflicting files are merged/staged even when conflicts exist elsewhere.\n  - Detects content overlaps, delete-vs-modify, add-add, and file-vs-directory type clashes.\n- Conflict handling:\n  - Writes conflict markers (`<<<<<<< HEAD`, `=======`, `>>>>>>>`) to worktree files.\n  - Records index stages 1/2/3, writing only stages for which a blob exists.\n  - Writes `.git/MERGE_HEAD` on the worktree `billy.Filesystem` and returns `ErrMergeConflicts`.\n  - Leaves HEAD unchanged on conflict.\n\n### `worktree_commit.go`\n- `Commit` now reads `.git/MERGE_HEAD` from the worktree filesystem, appends it as a second parent, and removes the file after a successful commit.\n\n### `worktree_status.go`\n- `Add` now clears all conflict stage entries (1/2/3) for a path and replaces them with a single stage-0 entry (also fixed `deleteFromIndex` to clear all stages on deletion resolution).\n\nAll relevant tests pass (fast-forward, 3-way, conflicts, delete-vs-modify, add-add, file-vs-dir, dirty worktree, no-config, repeated lines, SHA256, osfs, Add resolution, Commit with MERGE_HEAD). The changes are committed.",
          "tool_calls_sha256": [
            "7c071a9f17ab536a567f83afcf825a1b787d9d42eaac0dd245e445284dd18744"
          ]
        }
      ]
